# A schematic Motherlode Mine for replays. Not the real map: just its shape where the Pilot cares.
#
# Facts from RuneLite's own Motherlode plugin (runelite-client .../plugins/motherlode/MotherlodePlugin.java):
#  - the mine is map regions 14679-14681, 14935-14937, 15191-15193; every tile of this scene is in one of them
#  - both levels are plane 0; the upper level is told apart by ground height below -490
# Object names are RuneLite's (net.runelite.api.gameval.ObjectID).
#
#   y 5720 +--------------------------------------------+
#          | UPPER LEVEL (height -600)                  |
#          |   upVein1 upVein2          upperHopper     |
#          |               ladderTop                    |
#   y 5668 |=========== cliff, no way across ===========|
#          |               ladderBottom                 |
#          |   lowVein1 lowVein2        hopper   sack   |
#          | LOWER LEVEL (height 0)            bank     |
#   y 5616 +--------------------------------------------+
#        x 3704                                       3807

scene 3704 5616
height 3704 5670 104 50 -600
block 3704 5668 104 2

# the lower level
wall MOTHERLODE_ORE_SINGLE 3720 5640 as lowVein1
wall MOTHERLODE_ORE_SINGLE 3724 5640 as lowVein2
object MOTHERLODE_HOPPER 3750 5650 as hopper
object MOTHERLODE_SACK 3760 5645 as sack
name 90000 "Bank chest"                   # a stand-in chest: the Pilot finds banks by name
object 90000 3770 5640 as bank
object MOTHERLODE_LADDER_BOTTOM 3740 5667 as ladderBottom

# the upper level
object MOTHERLODE_LADDER_TOP 3740 5670 as ladderTop
wall MOTHERLODE_ORE_SINGLE 3720 5700 as upVein1
wall MOTHERLODE_ORE_SINGLE 3724 5700 as upVein2
object MOTHERLODE_HOPPER 3755 5690 as upperHopper

# an account that can mine here: 30 Mining, not boostable (oldschool.runescape.wiki/w/Motherlode_Mine).
# The upper level needs 57 Mining, not boostable, and 100 golden nuggets; the upper hopper 50 more (same page).
skill MINING 40
items INV RUNE_PICKAXE 1
